<shipBlueprint name="PLAYER_SHIP_LEAH_ACE" layout="leah_ace" img="leah_ace">
	<class>Leah's MFK Cruiser</class>
	<name>Original Ace M.</name>
	<unlock id="text_PLAYER_SHIP_LEAH_ACE_unlock"/>
	<desc>"But all this time, you didn't give a single shit about me. Well guess what! I've learned a thing or two from our past encounters. See, the reason I could never beat you was because time after time I specialized in only one thing. But those days are over. New ship, new guns, new armor. I've already killed your little Slug friend. And now, it's time I finally put an end to this little facade of mine by killing you."</desc>
